"Vauta couldn’t encrypt your meetings to save them. Try again. If it keeps happening, restart your Mac." = "Vauta no ha podido cifrar tus reuniones para guardarlas. Inténtalo de nuevo. Si sigue ocurriendo, reinicia el Mac.";

/* Ask: shown under the claims of an answer when none of them is verified */
"Vauta couldn’t find these words in the transcript. The moments it points to may still be right; check them before relying on this answer." = "Vauta no ha encontrado estas palabras en la transcripción. Los momentos que señala pueden ser correctos; compruébalos antes de fiarte de esta respuesta.";

/* Status detail */
"Vauta couldn’t open your encrypted meetings. If macOS asks for Keychain access, allow it, then try again." = "Vauta no ha podido abrir tus reuniones cifradas. Si macOS pide acceso al llavero, permítelo y vuelve a intentarlo.";

/* Storage error: a file system operation failed */
"Vauta couldn’t read or write your data on the disk." = "Vauta no ha podido leer ni escribir tus datos en el disco.";

/* Notice when removing a reminder or event Vauta added failed */
"Vauta couldn’t remove it. Nothing was changed." = "Vauta no pudo quitarlo. No se cambió nada.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"Vauta couldn’t translate %@. Try again, or choose another language." = "Vauta no ha podido traducir %@. Inténtalo de nuevo o elige otro idioma.";

/* Settings → Models; a file operation failed */
"Vauta couldn’t write the model to disk. Nothing was installed." = "Vauta no ha podido escribir el modelo en el disco. No se ha instalado nada.";

/* Documents pane: what removing a file source does */
"Vauta deletes its index of this file. Your files are not touched." = "Vauta borra su índice de este archivo. Tus archivos no se tocan.";

/* Documents pane: what removing a folder source does */
"Vauta deletes its index of this folder. Your files are not touched." = "Vauta borra su índice de esta carpeta. Tus archivos no se tocan.";

/* Microphone test result when nothing was heard */
"Vauta didn’t hear anything. Check the input in System Settings → Sound." = "Vauta no ha oído nada. Comprueba la entrada en Ajustes del Sistema → Sonido.";

/* Remember this voice error: there is no voice summary for this speaker */
"Vauta didn’t keep this speaker’s voice, so it can’t be remembered. Voices are only kept for %lld days, for meetings recorded or imported while “Recognize voices across meetings” is on, and only for people who spoke long and clearly enough." = "Vauta no ha conservado la voz de este hablante, así que no se puede recordar. Las voces solo se conservan durante %lld días, en las reuniones grabadas o importadas con «Reconocer voces entre reuniones» activado, y solo de quienes hablaron lo suficiente y con claridad.";

/* Capture error */
"Vauta doesn’t have permission to use the microphone." = "Vauta no tiene permiso para usar el micrófono.";

/* Status detail */
"Vauta doesn’t open when you log in." = "Vauta no se abre al iniciar sesión.";

/* Settings → Calendar */
"Vauta doesn’t read your calendars while this is off. You can also remove its access." = "Vauta no lee tus calendarios mientras esto esté desactivado. También puedes retirarle el acceso.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"Vauta forgets the server address, models and key. Minutes will use Apple Intelligence on this Mac until you set up a server again." = "Vauta olvida la dirección del servidor, los modelos y la clave. Las actas usarán Apple Intelligence en este Mac hasta que vuelvas a configurar un servidor.";

/* Status detail */
"Vauta has no access. Turn on Vauta in System Settings → Privacy & Security → Calendars." = "Vauta no tiene acceso. Activa Vauta en Ajustes del Sistema → Privacidad y seguridad → Calendarios.";

/* Documents pane: the limit of the index, shown when it is nearly full */
"Vauta indexes up to about %lld pages" = "Vauta indexa hasta unas %lld páginas";

/* Storage error: a second process tried to open the store */
"Vauta is already open in another instance." = "Vauta ya está abierto.";

/* Alert title */
"Vauta is already running" = "Vauta ya se está ejecutando";

/* Store open failure */
"Vauta is already running." = "Vauta ya se está ejecutando.";

/* Tooltip of a grey panel button while Erase Everything runs */
"Vauta is erasing your data." = "Vauta está borrando tus datos.";

/* Why a recording didn’t start: Erase Everything is running */
"Vauta is erasing your data. Try again when it finishes." = "Vauta está borrando tus datos. Inténtalo de nuevo cuando termine.";

/* Tooltip of a grey panel button while a backup is restored */
"Vauta is restoring your meetings." = "Vauta está restaurando tus reuniones.";

/* Why a recording didn’t start: a backup is being restored */
"Vauta is restoring your meetings. Try again when it finishes." = "Vauta está restaurando tus reuniones. Inténtalo de nuevo cuando termine.";

/* Why a recording didn’t start: the encrypted store isn’t open yet */
"Vauta is still opening your data." = "Vauta todavía está abriendo tus datos.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"Vauta is still opening your data…" = "Vauta todavía está abriendo tus datos…";

/* Why a recording didn’t start: the previous meeting is still being saved */
"Vauta is still saving the last meeting. Try again in a moment." = "Vauta todavía está guardando la última reunión. Inténtalo de nuevo en un momento.";

/* Save error: what to do when macOS refuses the write */
"Vauta isn’t allowed to write its data. Check the permissions of its data folder." = "Vauta no tiene permiso para escribir sus datos. Revisa los permisos de su carpeta de datos.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"Vauta keeps no audio, so it can’t separate this meeting’s speakers now" = "Vauta no guarda audio, así que no puede separar los hablantes de esta reunión";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"Vauta links the people, projects and clients you turn on to every meeting of this series." = "Vauta vincula las personas, los proyectos y los clientes que actives a todas las reuniones de esta serie.";

/* Setup last page subtitle */
"Vauta lives in the menu bar. Look for the waveform icon at the top of the screen." = "Vauta vive en la barra de menús. Busca el icono de onda en la parte superior de la pantalla.";

/* Settings → General */
"Vauta lives in the menu bar: click the waveform icon at the top of the screen to record, see live notes and open Meetings." = "Vauta vive en la barra de menús: haz clic en el icono de onda de la parte superior de la pantalla para grabar, ver las notas en directo y abrir Reuniones.";

/* Setup model step: what searching for servers does */
"Vauta looks for LM Studio, Ollama and others on this Mac." = "Vauta busca LM Studio, Ollama y otros en este Mac.";

/* Model guide: Ollama context instruction */
"Vauta needs a context length of at least 32K tokens. In Ollama, open Settings and move the “Context length” slider to 32K." = "Vauta necesita una longitud de contexto de al menos 32K tokens. En Ollama, abre «Settings» y mueve el control «Context length» a 32K.";

/* Model guide: before a command that reloads a model; Terminal is the macOS app */
"Vauta needs a context length of at least 32K tokens. In Terminal, load it again with a longer context length:" = "Vauta necesita una longitud de contexto de al menos 32K tokens. En Terminal, cárgalo de nuevo con una longitud de contexto mayor:";

/* Model guide: context length instruction before a command; Terminal is the macOS app */
"Vauta needs a context length of at least 32K tokens. In Terminal, load the model like this:" = "Vauta necesita una longitud de contexto de al menos 32K tokens. En Terminal, carga el modelo así:";

/* Model guide: low disk space when one model would fit; arguments are two sizes */
"Vauta needs about %@ (the download plus room to unpack); this Mac has %@ free. Free up space first, or turn on the “Use one model only” option." = "Vauta necesita unos %@ (la descarga más espacio para descomprimirla) y este Mac tiene %@ libres. Libera espacio primero o activa «Usar un solo modelo».";

/* Model guide: low disk space; arguments are the size needed, the free space and the size to free up */
"Vauta needs about %@, including room to unpack. This Mac has %@ free. Free up at least %@." = "Vauta necesita unos %@, incluido el espacio para descomprimir. Este Mac tiene %@ libres. Libera al menos %@.";

/* Follow-up sheet: before access to Reminders was asked; shown above the list of tasks */
"Vauta needs access to Reminders to add these tasks." = "Vauta necesita acceso a Recordatorios para añadir estas tareas.";

/* Reminder editor: before access to Reminders was asked */
"Vauta needs access to Reminders to add this task." = "Vauta necesita acceso a Recordatorios para añadir esta tarea.";

/* Model guide status detail; the argument is a token count */
"Vauta needs at least %@." = "Vauta necesita al menos %@.";

/* Setup page subtitle */
"Vauta needs to hear you and the other participants. Nothing is recorded until you start." = "Vauta necesita oírte a ti y a los demás participantes. No se graba nada hasta que empiezas.";

/* Settings → Calendar; before access was asked */
"Vauta needs your permission to read your calendars." = "Vauta necesita tu permiso para leer tus calendarios.";

/* Settings → Calendar & Reminders; before access to Reminders was asked */
"Vauta needs your permission to read your reminders." = "Vauta necesita tu permiso para leer tus recordatorios.";

/* Documents pane: macOS no longer lets Vauta read this source */
"Vauta no longer has access" = "Vauta ya no tiene acceso";

/* Answers card: first-run notice shown once, in the panel, before the first answer */
"Vauta now answers questions it hears, from this meeting, your past meetings and your documents. Answers appear only in this panel, which Vauta asks macOS to keep out of screen sharing; that is not guaranteed." = "Vauta ahora responde a las preguntas que oye, con lo que hay en esta reunión, en tus reuniones anteriores y en tus documentos. Las respuestas aparecen solo en este panel, que Vauta pide a macOS que deje fuera de la pantalla compartida; no está garantizado.";

/* Network Activity: under the summary when a destination is outside the local network */
"Vauta only expects connections on your Mac or local network. Check the address of your model server." = "Vauta solo espera conexiones en tu Mac o en tu red local. Revisa la dirección de tu servidor de modelos.";

/* Status detail */
"Vauta opens when you log in." = "Vauta se abre al iniciar sesión.";

/* Alert text when the Mac has no password */
"Vauta protects Meetings and Context with your login password or Touch ID. Without a password, anyone using this Mac can open them. You can set one in System Settings → Users & Groups." = "Vauta protege Reuniones y Contexto con tu contraseña de inicio de sesión o Touch ID. Sin contraseña, cualquiera que use este Mac puede abrirlos. Puedes establecer una en Ajustes del Sistema → Usuarios y grupos.";

/* Settings → Calendar & Reminders: what the brief reads from the calendar; in languages that put a space between the number and “hours”, make it a no-break space; Japanese and Korean write 12時間 and 12시간 with none, like the minutes in the same pane */
"Vauta reads in full only the meeting about to start and the next one within 12 hours: title, time, people and link. To time the notification it looks only at when the events of the next few hours start. It keeps no copy of your calendar, and the brief never writes to Calendar, Reminders or Notes." = "Vauta solo lee por completo la reunión que está a punto de empezar y la siguiente dentro de 12 horas: título, hora, personas y enlace. Para programar el aviso solo mira cuándo empiezan los eventos de las próximas horas. No guarda copia de tu calendario, y el resumen previo nunca escribe en Calendario, Recordatorios ni Notas.";

/* Settings → Calendar & Reminders: what showing reminders in the brief reads */
"Vauta reads only incomplete reminders in the lists you choose: title, due date, list and priority. It keeps no copy, and the brief never changes them." = "Vauta solo lee los recordatorios sin completar de las listas que elijas: título, fecha límite, lista y prioridad. No guarda copia, y el resumen previo nunca los cambia.";

/* Speaker popover: what saving the user’s own voice does */
"Vauta saves a fingerprint of this voice as yours on this Mac only and names this speaker “Me”. Later imported recordings can then suggest which speaker is you." = "Vauta guarda una huella de esta voz como tuya solo en este Mac y llama «Yo» a este hablante. Así, las grabaciones importadas más adelante podrán sugerir qué hablante eres tú.";

/* Settings → Recording */
"Vauta shows a suggestion when a meeting app starts using the microphone. It never starts recording on its own." = "Vauta muestra una sugerencia cuando una app de reuniones empieza a usar el micrófono. Nunca empieza a grabar por su cuenta.";

/* Consent sheet footnote: the time of the confirmation is stored; consent is the recording user’s responsibility; organizations are advised to cover it in a data protection impact assessment */
"Vauta stores the time you confirm this next to the voice. Consent is your responsibility as the person recording. Organizations should note voice recognition in their data protection impact assessment." = "Vauta guarda junto a la voz el momento en que lo confirmas. El consentimiento es responsabilidad tuya como persona que graba. Las organizaciones deberían incluir el reconocimiento de voces en su evaluación de impacto sobre la protección de datos.";

/* Setup page subtitle when the speech model is installed */
"Vauta transcribes with Apple’s speech model, which runs on this Mac." = "Vauta transcribe en este Mac con el reconocimiento de voz de Apple.";

/* Setup page subtitle */
"Vauta transcribes with Apple’s speech model, which runs on this Mac. It downloads once from Apple." = "Vauta transcribe en este Mac con el reconocimiento de voz de Apple. El modelo se descarga de Apple una sola vez.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"Vauta transcribes your meetings on this Mac and turns them into minutes, decisions and tasks you can search and ask about." = "Vauta transcribe tus reuniones en este Mac y las convierte en actas, decisiones y tareas que puedes buscar y consultar.";

/* Settings → Models network server explanation */
"Vauta uses a model server on another computer on your local network, over HTTPS only. It never sends meetings to the internet." = "Vauta usa un servidor de modelos en otro ordenador de tu red local, solo por HTTPS. Nunca envía reuniones a internet.";

/* About: the dependency statement; MLX (mlx-swift, MIT) is the one third-party package, and it runs the optional models Vauta downloads only on request. The button below it is “Credits and Licenses” */
"Vauta uses Apple frameworks, the SQLite library that comes with macOS, and MLX (mlx‑swift, MIT) with its swift‑numerics library (Apache 2.0). MLX runs the optional search and integrated models on this Mac; the models are downloaded only when you ask. Credits and Licenses lists everything." = "Vauta usa frameworks de Apple, la biblioteca SQLite que viene con macOS y MLX (mlx‑swift, MIT) con su biblioteca swift‑numerics (Apache 2.0). MLX ejecuta en este Mac los modelos opcionales de búsqueda e integrado; los modelos solo se descargan cuando lo pides. Créditos y licencias lo enumera todo.";

/* Event editor, first event written: where it goes and what Vauta never does */
"Vauta will add this event to %@. It never changes events you made." = "Vauta añadirá este evento a %@. Nunca cambia los eventos que hayas creado.";

/* Menu-bar panel, brief card: Record at Start was chosen in the notification; when the meeting begins Vauta suggests recording, it does not record by itself */
"Vauta will ask to record when it starts" = "Vauta preguntará si quieres grabar cuando empiece";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"Vauta will no longer transcribe this language until you download it again. macOS deletes the model when no other app uses it." = "Vauta dejará de transcribir este idioma hasta que vuelvas a descargarlo. macOS elimina el modelo cuando ninguna otra app lo usa.";

/* Meetings, Upcoming: under the brief of a first meeting with these people */
"Vauta will remember this one after you record it." = "Vauta recordará esta reunión cuando la grabes.";

/* Notification title before an automatic stop */
"Vauta will stop recording soon" = "Vauta dejará de grabar pronto";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"Vauta will stop sending a key to the server until you enter one again." = "Vauta dejará de enviar una clave al servidor hasta que introduzcas otra.";

/* Model provider recovery */
"Vauta will use it as soon as the download finishes." = "Vauta lo usará en cuanto termine la descarga.";

/* Settings → General, after setup when the menu bar icon couldn't be found */
"Vauta’s icon may be hidden in the menu bar, for example behind the notch. Open Vauta again from Finder, Spotlight or Apps to come back here." = "Es posible que el icono de Vauta esté oculto en la barra de menús, por ejemplo detrás de la muesca de la cámara. Vuelve a abrir Vauta desde el Finder, Spotlight o Apps para regresar aquí.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"Verified" = "Verificada";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"Verified: the quote appears word for word in the transcript" = "Verificada: la cita aparece literalmente en la transcripción";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"Verified: the quote appears word for word in your document" = "Verificada: la cita aparece palabra por palabra en tu documento";

/* About; arguments are the version and build numbers */
"Version %@ (%@)" = "Versión %@ (%@)";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"Versions and the checklist above, for a support request. No meeting content, names or addresses." = "Las versiones y la lista de comprobación anterior, para una solicitud de soporte. Sin contenido de reuniones, nombres ni direcciones.";

/* Accessibility label of the Meetings mode switch */
"View" = "Vista";

/* Settings → Speakers; header of the section with the switch that lets saved voices suggest who is speaking */
"Voice recognition" = "Reconocimiento de voces";

/* Entity card of a person: a voice fingerprint of them is saved in the encrypted store; the Delete button follows */
"Voice saved on this Mac" = "Voz guardada en este Mac";

/* Settings → Speakers; shown instead of the list of names while it is locked */
"Voices are saved on this Mac" = "Hay voces guardadas en este Mac";

/* Settings → Models activity */
"Waiting" = "En espera";

/* Accessibility value */
"Waiting for a shortcut" = "Esperando un atajo";

/* State of a note the model has not written out yet: the speaker may still be explaining it */
"Waiting for more of the meeting" = "Esperando más de la reunión";

/* Documents pane: a source whose files are queued */
"Waiting to index" = "Esperando para indexar";

/* Settings → Models; why indexing for search by meaning is paused */
"Waits for the charger." = "Espera a que conectes el cargador.";

/* Settings → Models; why indexing for search by meaning is paused */
"Waits until the recording is over." = "Espera a que termine la grabación.";

/* Settings → Models; why indexing for search by meaning is paused */
"Waits while Low Power Mode is on." = "Espera mientras el modo de bajo consumo esté activado.";

/* Settings → Models; why indexing for search by meaning is paused */
"Waits while your Mac cools down." = "Espera a que tu Mac se enfríe.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"Weak: add more words or characters." = "Débil: añade más palabras o caracteres.";

/* Settings → Recording audio source */
"Web meetings such as Google Meet are recorded through the browser that runs them, including all its tabs." = "Las reuniones web, como Google Meet, se graban a través del navegador que las ejecuta, incluidas todas sus pestañas.";

/* Placeholder of the recurring meeting title field */
"Weekly team meeting" = "Reunión semanal del equipo";

/* Setup first page title */
"Welcome to Vauta" = "Te damos la bienvenida a Vauta";

/* Placeholder of the Ask field */
"What did we decide about…? Who was handling…?" = "¿Qué decidimos sobre…? ¿Quién se encargaba de…?";

/* Ask example question; the argument is a meeting title */
"What did we decide in “%@”?" = "¿Qué decidimos en «%@»?";

/* Ask example question about the documents */
"What do my documents say about deadlines?" = "¿Qué dicen mis documentos sobre los plazos?";

/* Ask example question; the argument is a person's name */
"What does %@ have open?" = "¿Qué tiene pendiente %@?";

/* Ask example question about the documents; the argument is the name of a folder or file the person added */
"What is in “%@”?" = "¿Qué hay en «%@»?";

/* Placeholder of the glossary meaning field */
"What it stands for" = "Qué significa";

/* Section title on a person's card: passages the person said in meetings, from the speakers the user named as them */
"What they said" = "Lo que dijo";

/* Network Activity: tooltip and VoiceOver label of the info button */
"What this list doesn’t show" = "Lo que esta lista no muestra";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"What you can do" = "Qué puedes hacer";

/* Status detail; the arguments are a file size and a date */
"When Vauta replaced an earlier version, it kept a copy of your meetings (%@) just in case. The copy in Vauta’s folder is deleted on %@; the folder from the earlier version stays until you delete it." = "Al sustituir a una versión anterior, Vauta ha conservado una copia de tus reuniones (%@) por si acaso. La copia de la carpeta de Vauta se borra el %@; la carpeta de la versión anterior se queda hasta que la elimines.";

/* Status detail; the arguments are a file size and a date */
"When Vauta replaced an earlier version, it kept a copy of your meetings (%@) just in case. The copy is deleted on %@, or you can delete it now." = "Al sustituir a una versión anterior, Vauta ha conservado una copia de tus reuniones (%@) por si acaso. La copia se borra el %@, o puedes borrarla ahora.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"When a call starts, Vauta suggests recording. It never records on its own." = "Cuando empieza una llamada, Vauta sugiere grabar. Nunca graba por su cuenta.";

/* Settings → Calendar */
"When an event with a video call link is happening and a meeting app is in a call, Vauta suggests recording it. It never starts on its own. When you record, the meeting takes the event’s title and attendees." = "Cuando hay un evento en curso con un enlace de videollamada y una app de reuniones está en una llamada, Vauta te sugiere grabarla. Nunca empieza por su cuenta. Al grabar, la reunión toma el título y los asistentes del evento.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"When minutes are ready" = "Cuando un acta esté lista";

/* Settings → Recording, consent helper */
"When recording starts, the menu-bar panel offers a notice to paste in the meeting chat, in the language of the meeting. Vauta never sends it for you and never blocks recording." = "Al empezar a grabar, el panel de la barra de menús ofrece un aviso para pegar en el chat de la reunión, en el idioma de la reunión. Vauta nunca lo envía por ti ni impide grabar.";

/* Settings → Recording → Live answers, description when the model runs on this Mac */
"When someone asks a question that your meetings or documents can answer, a short answer with its sources appears in the panel. Nothing is spoken and nothing leaves your Mac." = "Cuando alguien hace una pregunta que tus reuniones o documentos pueden responder, aparece en el panel una respuesta breve con sus fuentes. No se dice nada en voz alta y nada sale de tu Mac.";

/* Settings → Recording → Live answers, description when the model is a server */
"When someone asks a question that your meetings or documents can answer, a short answer with its sources appears in the panel. Nothing is spoken. The meeting so far, the questions and the passages they need are sent to your model server, as with Ask." = "Cuando alguien hace una pregunta que tus reuniones o documentos pueden responder, aparece en el panel una respuesta breve con sus fuentes. No se dice nada en voz alta. La reunión hasta ese momento, las preguntas y los fragmentos que necesitan se envían a tu servidor de modelos, igual que con Preguntar.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"When something needs your attention" = "Cuando algo requiera tu atención";

/* Settings → General, under the follow-up card switch */
"When the minutes of a meeting are ready, the menu bar panel offers to review its tasks and follow-up meetings. It shows nothing from the meeting while Meetings are locked." = "Cuando el acta de una reunión está lista, el panel de la barra de menús ofrece revisar sus tareas y reuniones de seguimiento. No muestra nada de la reunión mientras Reuniones está bloqueado.";

/* Settings → General, under the follow-up card switch, while Vauta does not look for follow-up meetings */
"When the minutes of a meeting are ready, the menu bar panel offers to review its tasks. It shows nothing from the meeting while Meetings are locked." = "Cuando el acta de una reunión está lista, el panel de la barra de menús ofrece revisar sus tareas. No muestra nada de la reunión mientras Reuniones está bloqueado.";

/* Relock option */
"When the screen locks" = "Al bloquearse la pantalla";

/* Settings → Recording audio source */
"When you start recording, Vauta follows the meeting app that is using the microphone. If it doesn’t recognize the app, it records all system audio, so pause music and videos." = "Al empezar a grabar, Vauta sigue a la app de reuniones que está usando el micrófono. Si no la reconoce, graba todo el audio del sistema, así que pausa la música y los vídeos.";

/* Placeholder of the glossary note field */
"Where it’s used, who says it…" = "Dónde se usa, quién lo dice…";

/* Ask example question */
"Which questions are still open?" = "¿Qué preguntas siguen abiertas?";

/* Settings → Models; who writes live notes and answers questions during a meeting */
"While recording" = "Mientras grabas";

/* Settings → Models activity, with the integrated model as the provider and Apple Intelligence chosen for While recording */
"While recording, Apple Intelligence writes live notes and the integrated model stays idle. Minutes read the whole meeting when it ends, so they take longer to start." = "Mientras grabas, Apple Intelligence escribe las notas en directo y el modelo integrado permanece inactivo. Las actas leen toda la reunión cuando termina, así que tardan más en empezar.";

/* Settings → Models activity, with Apple Intelligence as the provider */
"While recording, Apple Intelligence writes live notes. Minutes are written when the meeting ends." = "Mientras grabas, Apple Intelligence escribe las notas en directo. El acta se redacta al terminar la reunión.";

/* Settings → Models activity */
"While recording, only the fast model runs (live notes). Minutes are written with the main model when the meeting ends; on a modest Mac that can take from a few minutes to more than half an hour per hour of meeting." = "Mientras grabas, solo funciona el modelo rápido (notas en directo). El acta se redacta con el modelo principal al terminar la reunión; en un Mac modesto puede tardar desde unos minutos hasta más de media hora por cada hora de reunión.";

/* Settings → Models activity, with the integrated model as the provider */
"While recording, the integrated model reads the meeting as it goes, so minutes usually start sooner when it ends." = "Mientras grabas, el modelo integrado va leyendo la reunión, así que las actas suelen empezar antes cuando termina.";

/* Settings → Speakers, details in the Learn More popover: the summary kept with a meeting; the argument is a number of days */
